    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Instant Lead Responder\nWebhook → AI qualifies the lead (score + category + draft reply) → Hot leads (70+) get an instant personalised reply, everyone else gets an acknowledgement → every lead is logged in Google Sheets.\n\nSETUP: 1) Import this JSON into n8n. 2) Header Auth credential for OpenAI: Authorization = Bearer YOUR_KEY. 3) Connect Gmail + Google Sheets, replace YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID, sheet tab must be named 'Leads' with headers: Timestamp, Name, Email, Service, Message, Score, Category, Status. 4) Activate, then test with the curl in the README.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "2f0caefc-877a-4599-b57c-64c66467de1a",
      "name": "README Note",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const lead = $json;\nconst system = `You are a lead qualification assistant for an AI automation agency run by Fahad Khan (services: AI agents & chatbots, n8n workflow automation, Python development). Score the lead 0-100 on buying intent and fit. Category: hot (70+), warm (40-69), cold (below 40). Draft a short, friendly, professional reply (max 80 words) that acknowledges their exact need, states one relevant benefit, and says a human will confirm a call shortly. Never invent prices, timelines, or guarantees. SCORING RUBRIC — judge the lead's actual words, not the message format. The Name, Email, Service and Message fields are real data, not placeholders: 80-100 (hot): a specific need matching our services PLUS urgency, a budget, or a timeline (for example: 'want to start this week', 'budget is 100000 PKR', 'call me today/tomorrow'). A clear buying signal such as a stated budget or a start date is enough for 75+ on its own. 40-69 (warm): a specific need but no urgency, budget, or timeline. 0-39 (cold): vague interest, only asking for information, no specific need, or not a fit. EXAMPLE: 'I need an AI chatbot for Instagram DMs that books appointments, want to start this week, budget 100000 PKR, call me today' is HOT — score 85-95. Never score such a lead below 70. Return ONLY valid JSON: { \"score\": number, \"category\": \"hot|warm|cold\", \"reason\": string, \"reply\": string }.`;\nconst user = 'Name: ' + lead.name + '\\nEmail: ' + lead.email + '\\nService interested in: ' + lead.service + '\\nMessage: ' + lead.message;\nconst body = {\n  model: 'qwen/qwen3.8-27b',\n  temperature: 0.3,\n  max_tokens: 400,\n  response_format: { type: 'json_object' },\n  messages: [\n    { role: 'system', content: system },\n    { role: 'user', content: user }\n  ]\n};\nreturn [{ json: { requestBody: JSON.stringify(body) } }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        448,
        288
      ],
      "id": "93eaa543-053f-4af1-95ce-26c59e1ab185",
      "name": "Build AI Request"
    }
